// go.work — the multi-module workspace (WS-011 / F039). It lists every module in
// the repo so local dev/build/test resolves cross-module references (adapter →
// root) to the WORKING TREE, with no `replace` directives or version pins. CI
// uses it for the local build/test matrix; published module go.mod files carry
// real `require`s, validated by the GOWORK=off per-module build in CI.
//
// As more adapters split out (config/koanf, events/kafkabus, persistence/*),
// add each new module's directory to the `use` block below.
go 1.25.5

use (
	.
	./observability/otel
)
